      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Esiteeri naaraliza Omukama na Hamani ha kigenyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro ekya kasatu, Esiteeri akajwara ebyokujwara bye eby'obugo, yazooka omu kikaali eky'omunda, omukaaruziika y'omukama, enyakuroleriire ekisiika ky'omukama. Omukama akaba asingire ha kitebe kye eky'obukama, omu kikaali omunda, aroleriire omulyango oguleeta omu kikaali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omukama obu yaboine omugo Esiteeri ayemeriire omu kikaali, yamusemerererwa, yamwolekeza n'omwigo ogw'ezaabbu ogu akaba akwasire nubwo Esiteeri yairiire haihi, yakwata ha ntuli y'omwigo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama yamukaguza ati: “Kiki omugo Esiteeri? Ngambira, eki orukwenda, noija kukitunga, noobu oraayenda ekicweka eky'obukama bwange.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esiteeri yagarukamu ati: “Nzaire, ninkusaba hamu na Hamani, mwije kiro kya hati, mwije ha bugenyi obu nkuteekaniriize.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo omukama yagambire ati: “Hamani araha? Arahuke bwango, tukole omugo eki arukwenda” Aho, omukama na Hamani baagenda ha bugenyi Esiteeri obu yateekaniize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu bakaba nibanywa eviini, omukama yakaguza Esiteeri ati: “Ngambira eki orukwenda, noija kukitunga ninyija kukuha kyona eki oraasaba, noobu oraayenda ekicweka eky'obukama bwange.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Esiteeri yagarukamu ati: Ekindukwenda kandi eki ndukusaba nikyo kinu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omukama obu araaba nankorra ekirungi akaikiriza kumpa eki ndukusaba, aije hamu na Hamani ha bugenyi obu ndukwija kubateekaniriza, obu nubwo ndaakora omukama nkooku agambire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hamani nahanuura kwita Morodekayi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiro eki, Hamani akagenda asemeriirwe muno kandi akyanganukire. Baitu obu yaboine Morodekayi omu irembo ly'omukama, Morodekayi ogu tiyayoleka kikorwa na kimu eky'okutamu omuntu ekitiinisa, eki kikabiihiza muno Hamaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu akagumiisiriza yataaha omunju; yatuma abantu bamwetere banywani be, yasaba namukazi we Zeresi agende ha bugenyi, okwihaho nyowe nyenka. Andaaliize kugenda n'omukama nyenkya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamani yasubirra ekitinisa ky'obuguuda bwe, n'obwingi bwabaana be, n'omulingo gwona omukama yamukulizemu, kandi nkooku yamumunyumiize okukira abakuru n'abairu b'omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamani akongeraho nabinu: “Ego, omugo Esiteeri ataikirize muntu ondi weena kugenda n'omukama habugenyi obuyatekaniize kwihaho nyowe nyenka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu eki tikiina eki kirukungasira, obu ndukurora Morodekayi Omuyudaaya aikaliire ha mulyango gw'omukama.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo mukazi we Zeresi na banywani be boona baamugarukiremu bati: “Ragira, bakole akabaaho ak'oburaiha obw'emikono amakumi ataano, ijo nyenkya, osabe omukama, aragire bahanikeho Morodekayi; nukwo ogende ha bugenyi osemeriirwe hamu n'omukama.” Ekiteekerezo eki Hamani yakisiima, yaragira baakora akabaaho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
